{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04004","headline":"晦日重宴 · 陈嘉言","name":"晦日重宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高门引冠盖，下客抱支离。\n绮席珍羞满，文场翰藻摛。\n蓂华雕上月，柳色蔼春池。\n日斜归戚里，连骑勒金羁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈嘉言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}